ecution are directly affected by mass, momentum, and load.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/847efa5e7f0589b43d875726011dcec0.webp?t=1773142114\" width=1170 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/cb4f38cc030993383399094d1d36b5f6.poster.avif?t=1773142114\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/cb4f38cc030993383399094d1d36b5f6.webm?t=1773142114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/cb4f38cc030993383399094d1d36b5f6.mp4?t=1773142114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Deployment within the Pioneer Program includes access to specialized tools and modular equipment required for station maintenance and surface activity. Effective use, transport, and configuration of issued equipment are the responsibility of the operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0d790b2073b724d8ba7f9837cfff4de1.webp?t=1773142114\" width=1170 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/72a91aeabd7db694e1fe625cd04a0bfe.poster.avif?t=1773142114\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/72a91aeabd7db694e1fe625cd04a0bfe.webm?t=1773142114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so